---
// Zero values for Go scalar and reference types vs explicit type conversion safety.
const W = 900;
const H = 286;
---
<figure class="gf1b">
  <div class="gf1b-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Go zero-value memory initialization table for numeric, string, bool, pointer, slice, and nil map panic safety, alongside explicit numeric conversion rules.">
      {/* Left panel: Zero Values table */}
      <rect x="14" y="14" width="460" height="258" rx="10" class="gf1b-card" />
      <text x="30" y="42" class="gf1b-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>1. Zero values guarantee clean memory at declaration</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Zero value: Go tự dọn sạch bộ nhớ khi khai báo biến</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="60" width="206" height="44" rx="6" class="gf1b-box is-ok" />
      <text x="42" y="79" class="gf1b-b-ok">var n int / float64</text>
      <text x="42" y="96" class="gf1b-m">Value: 0 / 0.0 (no garbage bits)</text>

      <rect x="248" y="60" width="210" height="44" rx="6" class="gf1b-box is-ok" />
      <text x="260" y="79" class="gf1b-b-ok">var s string  |  var ok bool</text>
      <text x="260" y="96" class="gf1b-m">Value: "" (len 0)  |  false</text>

      <rect x="30" y="114" width="206" height="50" rx="6" class="gf1b-box" />
      <text x="42" y="133" class="gf1b-b">var items []string</text>
      <text x="42" y="151" class="gf1b-m">nil · append(items, "a") works!</text>

      <rect x="248" y="114" width="210" height="50" rx="6" class="gf1b-box is-red" />
      <text x="260" y="133" class="gf1b-b-red">var m map[string]int</text>
      <text x="260" y="151" class="gf1b-m">nil: read=0, m["k"]=1 PANICS!</text>

      <rect x="30" y="176" width="428" height="80" rx="6" class="gf1b-box" />
      <text x="42" y="198" class="gf1b-b">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Design structs with useful zero values (Mutex, bytes.Buffer):</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Biến var mu sync.Mutex hay bytes.Buffer dùng được luôn:</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="42" y="218" class="gf1b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Go zeroes every byte before use — blocking uninitialized C bugs.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Go xóa 0 toàn bộ ô nhớ trước khi trao cho bạn — chặn lỗi rác C/C++.</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="42" y="237" class="gf1b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Only maps and channels need make() before writing or sending.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Chỉ riêng map và channel cần gọi make() trước khi ghi dữ liệu.</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Right panel: Explicit conversions & := rules */}
      <rect x="490" y="14" width="396" height="258" rx="10" class="gf1b-card" />
      <text x="506" y="42" class="gf1b-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>2. Strict types: zero silent casts</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Kiểu tĩnh chặt: không tự ép kiểu ngầm</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="506" y="60" width="364" height="62" rx="6" class="gf1b-box is-red" />
      <text x="520" y="81" class="gf1b-b-red">var i int = 5; var f float64 = i  // COMPILE ERROR</text>
      <text x="520" y="100" class="gf1b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Even int32 + int64 is forbidden without T(x) conversion.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Kể cả int32 cộng int64 cũng bị compiler chặn ngay tại chỗ.</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="506" y="132" width="364" height="60" rx="6" class="gf1b-box is-ok" />
      <text x="520" y="153" class="gf1b-b-ok">sum := float64(i) + 2.5  // explicit, clear precision</text>
      <text x="520" y="172" class="gf1b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Short declaration := infers type once inside functions only.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Cú pháp := suy kiểu tự động, chỉ dùng được bên trong hàm.</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="506" y="202" width="364" height="54" rx="6" class="gf1b-box" />
      <text x="520" y="222" class="gf1b-b">Typed constants (int) vs Untyped constants (42)</text>
      <text x="520" y="240" class="gf1b-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>const t = 5 * time.Second binds to Duration cleanly.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Hằng chưa gắn kiểu (5) tự khớp mượt khi nhân Time/Float.</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Unlike C where uninitialized locals contain random stack bytes, Go zero-initializes every variable safely—and requires explicit T(val) conversions so precision loss never hides silently.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Khác với C chứa rác bộ nhớ cũ khi vừa khai báo, Go tự động đặt mọi biến về zero value sạch sẽ — đồng thời bắt buộc viết rõ float64(x) khi chuyển kiểu để tránh sai số ngầm.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gf1b { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gf1b-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gf1b svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gf1b text { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gf1b-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .gf1b-box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gf1b-box.is-red { stroke: var(--red); fill: var(--red-tint-bg); }
  .gf1b-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gf1b-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gf1b-h { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gf1b-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gf1b-b-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .gf1b-b-ok { font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gf1b-b-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gf1b-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 11px; }
  .gf1b figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
